+    Items in the search path can also be ``(path, priority)`` tuples.
+    The sequence is sorted by descending priority before storing in
+    ``searchpath``. Entries with the same priority retain their input
+    order.
+
+    .. code-block:: python
+
+        loader = FileSystemLoader(
+            [("/override/templates", 10), "/default/templates"]
+        )
+
+    :param searchpath: A path, list of paths, or list of
